const e={readingNotes:[{title:{zh:"研究问题",en:"Research question"},body:{zh:"论文研究高低利率货币之间的横截面超额回报差异及其共同风险因子。 阅读时先把它理解为一个被界定的问题，而不是可以脱离样本、时间和制度环境的结论。",en:"“Common Risk Factors in Currency Markets” frames a bounded research question. Read the stated question together with the named sample, dates, and institutional setting rather than treating it as a conclusion that automatically travels to another market or period."},reference:{url:"https://doi.org/10.1093/rfs/hhr068",label:{zh:"Review of Financial Studies (2011) · 来源说明",en:"Review of Financial Studies (2011) · source description"}}},{title:{zh:"研究设计",en:"Research design"},body:{zh:"来源以货币组合、利率或远期贴水和共同冲击为核心，检验一个 slope factor 对横截面差异的解释。 这说明比较对象、观察窗口和对照关系是研究合同的一部分；改变其中任何一项，都可能改变所检验的命题。",en:"For “Common Risk Factors in Currency Markets”, the source describes a deliberate comparison, observation window, and control relation. Those choices are part of its research contract: changing one can change the proposition being tested, even when the method label remains the same."},reference:{url:"https://doi.org/10.1093/rfs/hhr068",label:{zh:"Review of Financial Studies (2011) · 来源说明",en:"Review of Financial Studies (2011) · source description"}}},{title:{zh:"数据与时点",en:"Data and timing"},body:{zh:"需要即期与远期汇率、利率口径、货币篮子组成、再平衡日期、时区和各国可得数据版本。 数据字段、可得时点和样本筛选需要与原始研究分开记录，不能仅凭同名变量或最终修订数据就视为可比。",en:"For “Common Risk Factors in Currency Markets”, keep the fields, their availability timing, and the sample filters separate from the original study. A same-named variable, later-revised database, or matching end-of-period date is not automatically a comparable input."},reference:{url:"https://doi.org/10.1093/rfs/hhr068",label:{zh:"Review of Financial Studies (2011) · 来源说明",en:"Review of Financial Studies (2011) · source description"}}},{title:{zh:"如何理解结果",en:"How to read the result"},body:{zh:"摘要描述特定货币组合中的共同风险暴露；它不将借低息、持高息货币变成无条件的未来收益承诺。 它支持的是该来源所描述的经验或理论关系；它本身不把相关性、模型拟合或历史表现升级为因果、可执行性或未来保证。",en:"For “Common Risk Factors in Currency Markets”, the source supports only the empirical or theoretical relation it describes. It does not turn association, model fit, or historical performance into causality, a directly executable procedure, or a guarantee about subsequent outcomes."},reference:{url:"https://doi.org/10.1093/rfs/hhr068",label:{zh:"Review of Financial Studies (2011) · 来源说明",en:"Review of Financial Studies (2011) · source description"}}},{title:{zh:"复核清单",en:"Replication checks"},body:{zh:"统一币种、期限、报价方向和日历，保留资本管制或交易限制，区分样本可得信息与后续修订宏观数据。 在做后续分析前，应把这些选择写入版本化的研究记录，并保留原始来源链接与访问日期。",en:"Before extending “Common Risk Factors in Currency Markets”, record its sample, timing, construction choices, and source edition in a versioned note. Keep the primary-source link and access date so a later reader can distinguish a changed definition from a changed result."},reference:{url:"https://doi.org/10.1093/rfs/hhr068",label:{zh:"Review of Financial Studies (2011) · 来源说明",en:"Review of Financial Studies (2011) · source description"}}},{title:{zh:"适用边界",en:"Scope boundary"},body:{zh:"该条导读引用 Review of Financial Studies (2011)。货币制度、融资约束和危机时期影响很大；历史因子关系不能直接用于任何市场或执行决策。 若需要量化结论、参数、表格或稳健性检验，请回到原文并单独核对版本、附录与样本定义。",en:"This guide cites Review of Financial Studies (2011) for “Common Risk Factors in Currency Markets”. Its public description defines the boundary. For numerical conclusions, parameters, tables, or robustness tests, return to the original and separately verify the edition, appendices, and sample definitions."},reference:{url:"https://doi.org/10.1093/rfs/hhr068",label:{zh:"Review of Financial Studies (2011) · 来源说明",en:"Review of Financial Studies (2011) · source description"}}}],readerLimits:{zh:"本文只整理“Common Risk Factors in Currency Markets”所公开说明的研究问题与设计边界，不构成收益预测、交易规则或全文复现。货币制度、融资约束和危机时期影响很大；历史因子关系不能直接用于任何市场或执行决策。",en:"This guide only organizes the publicly described question and design of “Common Risk Factors in Currency Markets”. It is not a return forecast, trading rule, or full-text replication. The source's stated scope remains controlling."}};export{e as default};
